      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4BFjZ5",
      "body": "Hi there,\r\n\r\nI'm not exactly Canadian, although I did consider [this](https://www.magazineluiza.com.br/roteador-movel-5g-4g-wifi-hotspot-com-slot-para-cartao-sim-para-10-usuarios-roteador-portatil-sem-none/p/fb1785ggah/tf/tfrl/?seller_id=aliexpress) MiFi:\r\n\r\nLTE-FDD\tB1,B3,B5,B8,B28\r\nLTE-TDD\tB34, B38, B39, B40, B41\r\nWCDMA\tB1/B8\r\n\r\nConectividade\t5G, 4G, 3G, WiFi 6\r\n\r\nRede Móvel\t5G, 4G, 3G\r\n\r\nIt supposedly gets delivered via AliExpress, and it does seem to be below the 100 USD threshold at the moment. Also, I find the eSIM thing unnerving.\r\n\r\nCheers",
